  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mUapW54ODMc&amp;list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHa_7iG77vMnyc9feaxTNhb\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mUapW54ODMc&amp;list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHa_7iG77vMnyc9feaxTNhb</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mUapW54ODMc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rpVnD/hyRXAO62mU/8e9sMDTOFTgBX2WQGCwKuk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mUapW54ODMc\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>영상 내용이 참 좋습니다.</p><p>특히 재과만 선생님들이 제작에 함께 참여했다는 점이</p><p>더욱 의미가 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ef5369;\"><b>(질문) 이 영상을 기본으로 할 수 있는 </b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ef5369;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 활동지를 제작하신 선생님이 계신가요?</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>영상과 함께 활동지가 제공된다면 금상첨화가 되리라 기대합니다!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
